{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["呼吁公义和怜悯"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大流士王执政第四年九月，即基斯流月四日，耶和华的话传给了撒迦利亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时，伯特利人差遣沙利色、利坚米勒及其随从去向耶和华求恩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们问万军之耶和华殿里的祭司和先知：“我们还要照多年的惯例在五月哀伤、禁食吗？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["万军之耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["“你要对境内的民众和祭司说，‘这七十年来，你们在五月和七月禁食、哀伤，难道真的是为了我吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你们吃喝，难道不是为自己吃、为自己喝吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["这些岂不是耶和华借从前的先知所宣告的吗？当时耶路撒冷和周围的城邑人口兴盛、繁荣，南地和丘陵都有人居住。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华又对撒迦利亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["“万军之耶和华曾对你们的祖先说，‘要秉公行义，彼此以慈爱和怜悯相待。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不可欺压寡妇、孤儿、寄居者和穷人，不可设阴谋彼此相害。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他们却不理会，顽梗地背过身去，充耳不闻，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["心如铁石，不遵从律法，也不遵从万军之耶和华借着祂的灵指示从前的先知所说的话。因此，万军之耶和华非常愤怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["祂说，‘我曾呼唤他们，他们不听；将来他们呼求我，我也不听。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我要用旋风把他们吹散到陌生的万国中，使他们的土地荒凉、杳无人迹，因为他们使美好的土地一片荒凉。’”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}